    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολύμνια</span></b> , ἡ, 
			contr.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολυύμνια,</span>
		<u>Polymnia</u> or <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Polyhymnia, she of the many hymns,</i> one of the Muses,
